  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing App Requirements**\n\nI\'m focusing on synthesizing the user\'s provided images and design specs to understand the application\'s overall structure. I\'m taking the user\'s prompt as the foundation to create this new application. The key is in analyzing those specific \"pantallas\" in the user\'s request.\n\n\n**Incorporating Visual Elements**\n\nI\'m now integrating the provided images into the design, specifically focusing on the tournament bracket and the various logos. The \"Comunidad Beyblade C\303\272cuta\" logo and the \"Beyblade X\" branding are vital. The attached images, like the tournament bracket with customizable options, are central to the user\'s vision. I am also working on the screen architecture and other specs such as the league format, battle scale and victory conditions.\n\n\n**Defining Battle Features**\n\nI am currently working to solidify the battle features, focusing on the core gameplay loop. I am defining battle mechanics like scoring systems for different finish types (Burst, Over, Spin, Stadium Out) to keep the user engaged. I\'m focusing on the \"Active Engagement/BATTLE CONSOLE\" screen where I am incorporating details like the red and blue corners, the match score display, the match reset button, and the \"On Deck\" match generator to facilitate continuous gameplay.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 2
      nanos: 343239144
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
