    thinking: "**Constructing Key Components**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the fundamental UI elements. I\'m building out `/src/components/Header.tsx`, `/src/components/Sidebar.tsx`, and the core battle interface `/src/components/screens/DashboardScreen.tsx`. This screen will be the heart of the action, featuring the battle console, live point displays, round history, target points, and essential controls like on-deck, rematch, and side switching. I\'m also planning the `/src/components/screens/ConfigScreen`.\n\n\n**Expanding the Interface**\n\nI\'ve moved on to fleshing out additional screens. The `/src/components/screens/BladersScreen.tsx` is under development for blader registration with combos and part selection. I\'m also implementing the interactive bracket at `/src/components/screens/BracketScreen.tsx`. I\'m working on the `/src/components/screens/MatchesScreen.tsx` screen now, too. The /`src/components/screens/EquipmentScreen.tsx` component is next, along with rules and history. Finally, I plan a winner modal with celebratory elements.\n\n\n"
