    thinking: "**Replacing Mock URLs**\n\nI\'m currently focused on cleaning up broken and mock image URLs. Specifically, I\'m replacing the `COMMUNITY_ASSETS` in `src/data/initialData.ts`. The initial goal is to swap those broken or mock `lh3.googleusercontent.com` URLs with pure and working image sources.\n\n\n**Developing Emblem Badges**\n\nI\'m now generating stylized CSS badges and official-looking vector logos. The plan is to create `BladerAvatar` and `BeybladeIcon` components. I\'m dynamically rendering authentic Beyblade X emblems with vibrant team colors, initials, and distinct designs for each type (Sword, Wing, Scythe, etc.). These will be used when no custom image is uploaded, or based on the blader\'s profile. I\'m removing mock URLs from `BladersScreen.tsx` and replacing them with stylish emblem badge/insignia choices. This applies also to `EquipmentScreen.tsx`.\n\n\n"
