 </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      ) : (\n        <div className=\"p-3.5 rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-slate-300 dark:border-white/10 text-center flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-xs font-label-caps text-slate-500 uppercase\">\n          <span className=\"material-symbols-outlined text-base text-amber-500\">emoji_events</span>\n          <span>Torneo en fase de clasificaci\303\263n \342\200\242 El campe\303\263n se definir\303\241 en la Gran Final</span>\n        </div>\n      )}\n\n      {/* Bracket Display */}\n      {matches.length === 0 ? (\n        <div className=\"glass-panel p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-dashed border-[#bec7d3]/40 dark:border-white/10 text-center space-y-4\">\n          <div className=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-[#04A8FC]/10 border border-[#04A8FC]/30 flex items-center justify-center text-[#04A8FC] mx-auto\">\n            <span className=\"material-symbols-outlined text-3xl\">account_tree</span>\n          </div>\n          <h3 className=\"font-headline font-black text-xl uppercase text-[#1a1c1e] dark:text-white\">\n            Bracket Vac\303\255o\n          </h3>\n          <p className=\"font-body-text text-sm text-gray-500 max-w-md mx-auto\">\n            A\303\272n no hay enfrentamientos en el \303\241rbol de eliminaci\303\263n. Registra Bladers en el Roster y haz clic en &quot;Generar Fixture&quot; o crea duelos manualmente.\n          </p>\n          {bladers.length >= 2 && (\n            <button\n              onClick={() => {\n                soundManager.playClick();\n                onGenerateBracket();\n              }}\n              className=\"bg-[#04A8FC] hover:bg-[#008fe0] text-white px-6 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-headline font-bold text-xs uppercase shadow-md shadow-[#04A8FC]/20\"\n            >\n              Generar \303\201rbol con los {bladers.length} Bladers Inscritos\n            </button>\n          )}\n        </div>\n      ) : viewMode === \'rounds\' ? (\n        /* Mobile-first