      title: "fandom.com"
    }
    summary: "Here\'s a summary of Beyblade Wiki image availability for the requested characters:\n\n**Ekusu Kurosu**\nImages of Ekusu Kurosu (also known as Jaxon Cross or Kamen X) can be found on his Beyblade Wiki page, which details his blonde/blue hair and blue eyes[1][2]. Additional PNG images are also available on platforms like DeviantArt[3]. He is the protagonist of the *Beyblade X* anime and manga[1][2].\n\n**Valt Aoi**\nValt Aoi has extensive image galleries available on the Beyblade Wiki[4][5]. His character is described with blue hair and brown eyes[4][6]. The galleries include images from various *Beyblade Burst* seasons, concept art, posters, and promotional materials[5].\n\n**Gingka Hagane**\nGingka Hagane\'s Beyblade Wiki pages feature details about his appearance, including dark red spiky hair, golden-brown eyes, and a blue headband with a Pegasus design[7]. While specific direct image links aren\'t provided in the snippets, the character pages themselves indicate the presence of images and galleries[8][9]. He is the main protagonist of the *Metal Saga*[10][9].\n\n**Tyson Granger**\nTyson Granger has dedicated image gallery pages on the Beyblade Wiki and BeyBlade: The Original Series Wiki[11][12]. He is depicted with blue hair and blue eyes, and often wears a backwards red, blue, and white hat[13]. These galleries contain images from different seasons of the original *Beyblade* series, such as *Beyblade: 2000*, *Beyblade: V-Force*, and *Beyblade: G-Revolution*[12].\n\nSources:\n[1] [fandom.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGVkw9vEqWieRmfm1ZGc58j2Ugc9AuaAwN-Kz2-bsqP8L2kCzSY9yNiQ2O3CWH5J7WyeECgdf2JA4vMMvuKxPdQA2CPvJQg2GCyfLGCfuFdShb_LMv0HHMz8SYy9ZEphTI6EktL8tZNh4VyvQ==)\n[2] [fandom.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFItn-Lnj-_g2jPrAYHhX2N5u6TZPrj56OmKhxZQk6qnX2FpyC72b8O7yO2FRD_dW89dAvCGKBG86jdzijFtlFM_zldOLy2jwAQdRxHUZl7W3Yvx5CyOLA2Abu5QeXJWuNZAVfp5WiW)\n[3] [deviantart.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGIM7et1YE715jndYQVp62ldOuYWjp7X89WHT9O0GZJ6kahB4zNqtX6qFp_Z0G0kZv64VwnqybmGOeQQLjrPVLCOBRh6--YBk76GvMB7NqUXmoe08EhOXfj26KebW9b-D1AG02YrKBle84IucJ3IftbFicHT7Vr_PDzZJpi5xXnsEg6)\n[4] [fandom.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEU9coGiKrzFWKy1Qo2Fpbj4FruHFKo1qDcJZU7JIutA5C9cJtZpLj5ttTssI7hSkxUcvNtCa3YN9y8a0r1JXv4P3DtVv7_8ki7sPhcmDpfLHcHOjDE6OMnzH8GWujVv0DvS1J94lxQvSAoWm3MlWRx)\n[5] [fandom.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEc2Jl_V0HDwBcW5jvA3_9yGdhn3UXH_7FgrhA1QwbUyi7bNaNsMHaRR7DloyFjz8NrjQNc6JsD_-Ah3Q6QyXW6aaN97K6l33cEi16z_F9pnVjYsm8ZwtvR0oXEuoHyq01_-eEaudMUKwsEx_o=)\n[6] [fandom.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGkrpF2-6bISOmiscM-DQeZxlaBc5bIoZq2krHKbQwEbIOzcIUgzm6aj_cGEzDmi7-LdTBelQlVO9hUO4d7FWfhts4rajSzQg5I1Uq-P8eMmSjobvZRJ-DqXu3fwJfuBMwLDh0wRt1G)\n[7] [fandom.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH8Hm3FhYJ9aAsisRVAbFumBPshdW2amIb-f6ZXPav4u-wUe1-W9sH3MMzXWDTVdf7hScVAmDxYilTg39xixe0ltz5dFFQBElokg0ytTKgqPr4ey6LUVu9rhTZUht64nfxw52hMUwXUgMAungwyDDxpd9yzHkc=)\n[8] [fandom.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGZgN5zsSkWjd0vaWb-XNiPPhadOPsN1Ucgby3F9jgPylhK1y1IzMZ4-UH1gKl_5WFO4kxe4DXY_GLyi5RJRG-d0UXxeQfw7Ejpz8YIlco192_NVZ_4PfrplZ1FRtXRk3LdPby6D720WF1qHg==)\n[9] [fandom.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFt9qhYWKjfybS2cagk1HzGVRfVO5Dh9Hxy3A2q4CYErm-tt9t9wBvnhS1SPCQvoqdgVVLkRG-OvFpON4ByvglPCZI9v67cqf-y8VK41D8Iu72T5hgYcuRDIycIV-9SEY-1C-NMF7JjZCe9SjlS)\n[10] [fandom.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGVn42JeKaZfmI0XNYrdVZ2f7MrrKcAsyEMr3bn_0-qV6BDnTRXimBt6Ix_mxBhAAxJ6MxSCwFtr4sWc86rel2rLTUpD_CvJ-yb7aLt8cSorG3P-GsLN07_kd3rEgfuf4g_x86boXRaUTqhLWw=)\n[11] [fandom.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEwOvpzd3i_P