    summary: "The following information was found on `static.wikia.nocookie.net` (Fandom wikis) regarding the specified characters:\n\n*   **Ekusu Kurosu** is identified as the main protagonist of the *Beyblade X* anime and manga series. He battles with Dran Beyblades.[1] He was formerly a member of Team Pendragon, champions of The X, and now, under the guise of Blader X, aims to challenge his former teammate Khrome Ryugu.[1]\n*   **Valt Aoi** is the main protagonist of the *Beyblade Burst* and *Beyblade Burst Evolution* anime and manga series, and a significant character in *Beyblade Burst Turbo* through *Beyblade Burst QuadStrike*.[2] He is an enthusiastic Beyblader who founded the Beigoma Academy\'s official BeyClub and served as its captain.[2][3]\n*   **Gingka Hagane** is the primary protagonist of the *Metal Saga* in *Beyblade*.[4][5] He holds the title of \"#1 Blader in the World\" and is known for saving the world on multiple occasions, including ending the dark power corruption of Ryuga and the Dark Nebula Organization and vanquishing the God of Destruction, Nemesis.[4]\n*   **Tyson Granger**, known as Takao Kinomiya in Japan, is the main protagonist of the original *Beyblade* series, which includes *Beyblade*, *Beyblade: V-Force*, and *Beyblade: G-Revolution*.[6][7] He is a member and leader of the G-Revolutions and the BBA Revolution, and his Bit-Beast and Beyblade is Dragoon.[6][7] He is recognized as the \"#1 Beyblader in the World,\" having won three world championships consecutively.[8][9]\n\nSources:\n[1] [fandom.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHt0i3v9QRny_XnQXzehoGYQaM-BvzTSXrv92IVqrVp-k-F8DVk8h4sX3fX2THFyzH2GSwhSQH84y08gTislAojUeUF8ptqAi4FFtzYe5gNRvnoxIR2yXWGNMeHJiFkcXF89VlxT8mwrIbb7w==)\n[2] [miraheze.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHpLTwJR5EU6miLGD-79zh0lCue5VMyxa5un-bBA4ecuMLgpt10uSlcgO1-7YqgQegtjx3XzmQpU18LdBAsipaWK8Lz4ts9QZYHDpxrGISL2ciYkdPTuYargzbEvJhViWGAXoOv1ue8pVi_XRF_)\n[3] [fandom.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHa4Z7QdN86oxtSd_Vy7BwPl-e3nsG3Gd1We8U5ToY56avRutOTu7tW-asGPt4CQYr3r9zZXj6Tp48djECOgr7pLkYJDdWnlneiN2S9GCodiEm3ck06yJGDncjf-iBAYU9zHhg_QSpo0lSwvcvTqv8W5MdUFrIKCmzE)\n[4] [fandom.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHkOJpBLz3CK-uhlNnrjWqxItxY1bJBs42oiXsTRk5lz_M-yKe8ZiYbcurqhaHwTu9BfyWoPMpMY4BqjLl0Wkq8Q5j-TurIA1J4dJeJ9ClmjYIqCRciUOakEuTg1mlSTu3ukVNCzPf1eQ==)\n[5] [fandom.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFqBArrDybt3ozgCeyIaaAOrVBFfRNhqpR6FtEDJLn5hX26P2cZOzIyyBzL95r6bUoXEH3yVnk9yTkypnvTjxeSAZM6H7GV2erzYDR4EqVoWoU4dPBqbfeEq5YmmSUATkJJ1Yc37kITxsILIqoRnQ==)\n[6] [fandom.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFNvc2lqlsZc5GGh-JnFUPjRNN6acxzLyo00oD9SOSkTQAh1bx4e0ZbPTD1vtPPA9wqn7HNyTsoE2sCGBKAyOjT2NEjSKXSk1wuTyQODRtrLRhYPSrn_zzhnIvGJuoqjWTzvi7kvsj0Tw==)\n[7] [fandom.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF2IerkJJfogTj8Q1SkW8KerhKiVs9qtECF_66h2A4_6qi5wURDU7dNvob4pfGXQRMFpmrOR5PlQzLXt9-Lp1cm1FOVPlWGKJ0kM4nuv8zn3bHoyczi0KQXf6rqQia2On8KlVOL6F8xOgg=)\n[8] [miraheze.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEl2Y6BFO5mPd50Tmo6SCcdottWjt7waaPbEDKEPw0pyqTUxI5X2LcbDhXw0im-coX5DD90o-ACO2N19STflz_d-EliBASGk0onj8UlAitUXVlB-wuUrBx9JNFosWC0WSnUuJdeE4dM8uPXQfQUNad-fTo=)\n[9] [fandom.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEnTI5JbKXiCB7H4WiI3dy0AcFi2-sX8cMAA_-uEv7qJhX_5S2qpWQwu34xzDhGBLcJLxmqLSYuiP9-fk4AD0JwKy2SPxVTOl2VMX0rryfHvZFNvydqEZC8qKSbJfHR91x-GlxB4KtZOspnRNzN6w==)"
