    summary: "Here\'s where you can find images for the specified Beyblade characters on the Beyblade Fandom Wikia:\n\n*   **Ekusu Kurosu (Jaxon Cross):** You can find images of Ekusu Kurosu (also known as Jaxon Cross) from *Beyblade X* on their gallery page: Jaxon Cross/Gallery on the Beyblade Wiki.[1] There are also various fan art and PNG images available on platforms like DeviantArt and Tenor by searching for \"Ekusu Kurosu\" or \"Kurosu Ekusu\"[2][3][4][5][6].\n*   **Valt Aoi:** For Valt Aoi, the main protagonist of *Beyblade Burst*, a comprehensive collection of images can be found on the Valt Aoi/Gallery page of the Beyblade Wiki.[7][8] Additional pictures and transparent PNGs are also available through image searches.[9][10]\n*   **Gingka Hagane:** Images for Gingka Hagane, a prominent character from the *Metal Saga*, are available in galleries like Gingka Hagane on the Universal Warriors Wiki and Beyblade Toy Wiki.[11][12] You can also find wallpapers and PNG images by searching for his name.[13][14][15]\n*   **Takao (Takao Kinomiya / Tyson Granger):** Takao Kinomiya, the protagonist of the original *Beyblade* series (also known as Tyson Granger), has image galleries such as Takao Kinomiya/Gallery on the Heroes Wiki and Takao Kinomiya on the Beyblade Wiki (Miraheze).[16][17] His appearance and Beyblades are also detailed on these pages.[18][19]\n\nSources:\n[1] [fandom.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFcD0d-MJK3NTGrX-Ii6tHS8nCZyyy6GTqB2fjNVYaK9-sll0sHIa041u-JLYvfhUuYQVERqGEFCQewJijaARmYsUD_P2uucRoSiiItIgby8ZcJ8PB1-wciKjpITPV_3v_FGg2Rq78=)\n[2] [deviantart.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE3sSHnwZRSegPxoEd_w9gVFua7uEszREdjI8A_gOlAn6rwvOQYBV4HBxu8AXyVXPG3IAzUfG4aBra5GqmdPcuguLliHzmB8BcHkHA1MDUG6qRRDgLluFomB8cVycHIP1EvvNLQAyXQYuVGkOdXHZgj_90xcmEE8gnK5cl2n5SS7lY=)\n[3] [deviantart.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEl706iNhAEixyfonb-HdoA776_Fz3ijxbd1fy9vsW2NRGa5c1Vtjtr93txEEV17c4CJRzfdTi8s4LtlBdjuhkdqqmLbp32jBljwc0B51vjoJ7kOZHZqycQhy0oIp2HF0j_t8xEfi81wPXxcOnmXIPDm8yXoZknrX4HeM1SGY7YejK-VUyUT8AE)\n[4] [deviantart.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFEjTN_GmkXyuV1iwyHp3JdTjAG3jY4COJpKnU3n0Qs2Vxk6DUtcENxP-fHKkCftfbHQqlBdVjNp6RplRezqSCyjsU7c1OtVIQcJKFN808fw34j_fCWbPddBlgfEHN-2ma-XvG4ZmpetEzn7c9L3i-vp7YCUmJzVaN9JaC4w6GBtPs=)\n[5] [deviantart.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH0rXV45wGmSRsOxXFkTdjIy7fs3H0LjUSPJPV9DkNweFIHxyAG09ikpCrx6-lYpsByJB_rgWaigkAZfCJ-MqRPgvzGqob-i6EMNbN_rAFsoarNGpC2nDq4cvJgDgBx03-2SyoiHTTrlOABWSWFU1B4m06sgSHh)\n[6] [tenor.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEvLbgb5xRFSiBX8yWIKVIaOFWX7UI_guWXRm6KCIuDw3FYRoNLfVoE0RnmBmqGqY2JyEKrlhtYfIfiqCfg-uXq9gHuzF23KyUsc2l9Zxv4mjsC0DqM6JS2opn7_ZWxCo2H95wyvAOK55QKp_QhnYBsGFb1oVygjQ6SLZYl_RKcxk8s5dUn89Dx7Zt199jhlsB-qI9W8oNVPj36uuu9)\n[7] [fandom.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEKSUDW7Sjxdb_lRU0oVpcYo_DjygpeDvlpZbi6hFo6NZ6oHlKltEHK96iStORZkCGbKybMifyxuELfKkIQ_LMSLto-K22FUrhm53XL6QiSJ8Z2zgYtrOeoqrBu_PrBXRiPI4OTmahMn9w=)\n[8] [fandom.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH8a4_5U9rd0maHwj39Po6t4efYU0byYwfasYFLxifD-WZ9BH54nA7CyPwXjc2DGGTgqXY5Mdgn0HjcW3ZUpUWv4iTtRfmTWNeLSLTluTuK4uIHR8MEvykoDEvSo7oL8m77csv_z35DnJRqtQ==)\n[9] [alphacoders.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFwO7sc9i0CfCVNv72pw5HoVnmbb3m8CbksutBInYJhqpbXqCS91CYOxL5U0hl41cFB__QvLyWhwUBueO5McwtAZHIJnjjYvzaKTe1CQuBygRrz3xv-5ne1BcA=)\n[10] [cleanpng.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHXrXmjf0ZBcXdbXRGwYeFQmwg5tDIZGBfjPAaDXcquq-8VZVFSio7KYBTD7LoixiuxrGwWx4D99ErwJEORMbzxzFRfxLo56Pt0P9BaS26H_wEXa2VdlPzGtmVkBrWChVSa-00UtA==)\n[11] [fandom.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEmlqU-1BCCxn_g0tWgJVgkdez90