  search_web {
    query: "\"Ekusu_Kurosu\" site:static.wikia.nocookie.net/beyblade"
    web_documents {
      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE8zK0GbQD3qYs4et04tUt9pgPpIby9xKQgvTAGGyX50XccqE8hk2Kv9eIWG1nylvvSJNw7KFkBisgQCDlWYH1R8P7dRP-_swUXfLjvlQVHmMHAv1MW6H84JE70OY5-76v4Pw5_9KWKh8atQQ=="
      title: "fandom.com"
    }
    summary: "Ekusu Kurosu (\351\273\222\351\240\210\343\202\250\343\202\257\343\202\271, Kurosu Ekusu), also known as Jaxon Cross, is the main protagonist in the *Beyblade X* anime and manga series[1]. He was formerly a member of Team Pendragon, who were champions of \"The X\" tournament[1]. He later adopts the masked identity of Blader X as he aims to return to the top and challenge his former teammate, Khrome Ryugu[1].\n\nEkusu is known for enjoying beybattles and having fun while competing[1]. He forms Team Persona with Robin[1]. His blading skills are characterized by immense power and speed[1].\n\nKey details about Ekusu Kurosu include:\n*   **Nicknames:** Kamen X (\344\273\256\351\235\242 X \343\202\250\343\203\203\343\202\257\343\202\271, Kamen Ekkusu), Mysterious Super Rookie[1].\n*   **Birthday:** January 23[1].\n*   **Hair Color:** Blonde/Blue[1].\n*   **Eye Color:** Blue[1].\n*   **Occupation:** Blader[1].\n*   **Beyblades:** His primary Beyblades include Sword Dran 3-60F, Dagger Dran 4-60R, Buster Dran 1-60A, Courage Dran S 6-60V, Courage Dran H 6-60V, and Coil Orochi 6-60LF[1]. Sword Dran 3-60F was a parting gift from his mentor, while Dagger Dran 4-60R and Dran Buster 1-60A were created by Multi Nana-iro[1].\n*   **Voice Actors:** Soma Saito (Japanese), AJ Beckles (English), and Hardi Dian Anto (Indonesian)[1].\n\nSources:\n[1] [fandom.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE8zK0GbQD3qYs4et04tUt9pgPpIby9xKQgvTAGGyX50XccqE8hk2Kv9eIWG1nylvvSJNw7KFkBisgQCDlWYH1R8P7dRP-_swUXfLjvlQVHmMHAv1MW6H84JE70OY5-76v4Pw5_9KWKh8atQQ==)"
    third_party_config {
      provider: THIRD_PARTY_WEB_SEARCH_PROVIDER_GEMINI
    }
    search_type: SEARCH_WEB_TYPE_WEB
  }
}
