      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF1Dt44XzCg2dbPIyHNywjm3dRPUvKoS7m4Ag3e5szqFnOldH2Y4L-WiSAHojJ7T22zWbj0S8kFzW7ctQTu4Vq7xkN9KLnScg1ZdIlkFQWg4RZm6wgYHlRhloJJDLGyGW6cjD9h_OdvJrJuzXLeB9y9WrMEuy1cPXzT0OB9mKLWnptknCu99gpVVw=="
      title: "makeagif.com"
    }
    summary: "Images for the Beyblade characters Jaxon, Ekusu, Valt, Gingka, and Takao are widely available across various online platforms, including dedicated fan wikis and image-sharing sites.\n\nSpecifically:\n*   **Valt Aoi** has numerous wallpapers available on sites like Wallpaper Cave and Wallpapers.com[1][2][3][4]. A dedicated \"Valt Aoi/Gallery\" page exists on the Beyblade Wiki (Fandom), showcasing a comprehensive collection of images for the character[5].\n*   **Gingka Hagane** also has a significant presence of images, with wallpapers found on Wallpaper Cave[6][7] and various PNG images available on sites like PNGWing and DeviantArt[8][9].\n*   **Kinomiya Takao**, also known as Tyson Granger, has images featured on Zerochan Anime Image Board[10][11][12][13]. While one wiki entry noted a lack of image information, it also detailed his Beyblades[14].\n*   **Jaxon Cross** (known as Ekusu Kurosu in Japan) has fan art and images on DeviantArt[15][16]. He is often associated with the aliases Blader X or Kamen X, and GIFs featuring him are available on platforms like Tenor[17][18][19]. His profile on the Beyblade Wiki (Fandom) includes a gallery section[20].\n*   **Ekusu Kurosu** is closely linked with Jaxon Cross and Kamen X. Images, fan art, and GIFs of Ekusu are found on DeviantArt and Tenor[21][22][23][17][24]. His alias as Ekusu Kurosu is also noted on the Beyblade Wiki (Fandom)[20].\n\nWhile a direct search for user-facing galleries specifically on \"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/beyblade/images/\" did not yield explicit results, the images for these characters are extensively hosted and cataloged on the broader Beyblade Wiki domain (Fandom) and other major image repositories.\n\nSources:\n[1] [wallpapercave.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFzwtO7zeMih6pOQpbWAzIhkStR5kfTrH_BJ0FXPBcUZLWM6XAujcyJmo9PpBEVvmrU3ukamqzd0QVhXvtqKBAN8AdVfizKkORW3AKnqlJPkaqC2Ix4AuSLQ9YBYFvdpvvO3077qn6xQsfhO5zlf3sX)\n[2] [wallpapers.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEJcTHMBg_RBRR-7I2G5WrbII1dHKdEaECumS-sE6GuVZmKAI-zorxnzmEvy4KuQzjQLOtSuWdM79Hw487nQxiJWCOmoxJy3jjucVr0TYmqyfHpvBAv9EPb0g==)\n[3] [alphacoders.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEl0N8yoQuLnmZ7zR-Ofh0AV9TULaMnPihgYPEmNhI41ypbfgkRoci8yMlST2eyN_uDOYA-MiHMZ3vXS5gbJ3Avqu8LZl258GQ1y-nSr4XKGPoViBA4l1lz9oU=)\n[4] [wallpapercave.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE82PRvtCpabPp8_OQq6vZjTtkPTiZR1yY1YbCFd2kbAI0-TAg3TIdzQOiZlyurPiICv5Fu7gOXf6eSoUUJvbss8qegQXF9xAeTPgt5_ls2CvATYuHu6TEHcosJqzQZ7nl63b0HIC_DU_F8M6K-3li5C8YD8Q24ZJoAoTeK)\n[5] [fandom.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFhEH_5VHd55X2ke4PXxEKfYiiI1J6XgHGcmDcaAPkOICt5VSFPn2CiUlLr-67NM_YFnHqj3yYmzF0Bja9ikEAGF7kUbGQtnFV2UVupRIVSzBIQcUAwvpP2JqE1cE2oVpJ9IU0d8zqNgssLVw==)\n[6] [wallpapercave.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG2DRwTi1HwmF5Dld-Ut1gPBNL7Lp02NdnRk7X7eNMDp2bI-FqEUlH8-Aquw_6bydZ5AuiNIk1aNZ9d212Lpo00TjGI07VKpVncFytHtSO9iqoxB1lU-nkCBDsPxOD_grSxhvDeay2ePA9CR99Z7g==)\n[7] [wallpapercave.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHh7mkI_0nL-9BBqTwPG-4qDHaeNMSwPwRT9mVjfmsFIRuXI3itkNcfbIkvzT-Wac7WaAVddfGi_YKmkT-F9fekoZ5VLMSOytS8x6xNNQjR_JhkJMyCT6ffxbp0docGSr4q02Wr2akvGzmcJL8=)\n[8] [pngwing.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHPJH7tsR5_SU1_46EXqf1_dNXPMYbyEWilfhNpDy6tIg7ZsOGU96pR5reAi9ve4wQwYhzmK-JKqq0QwhYHKBJReasym6J1ovJvYPJ6evFV93yyCOSy8K53zMn8cn3nD-Yz7-1yruGmiliHZQ==)\n[9] [deviantart.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGFOSZbTCbZuQiuuWufXNPEIs_qlnUDInarcAX5cpmjMrlPk4jSbBUKC6cIIonWMbdxVryosVSRp01w5o4tMqxSzFl3nrHkKb2_G27537VWP9L8XYN8K2N9F-LbiD0BA0gZOFDRF9hNapsoAf9UcJe-l-Ee9j_gH_ORZQnFvExegL3vIFoT4ajN9MqgIa9DYsQl7Q==)\n[10] [zerochan.net](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-re