    summary: "Here are some image URLs for \"Ekusu Kurosu\" from Beyblade:\n\n*   [https://www.deviantart.com/airielashf23/art/Kurosu-Ekusu-PNG-1190007975](https://www.deviantart.com/airielashf23/art/Kurosu-Ekusu-PNG-1190007975)[1][2]\n*   [https://www.deviantart.com/airielashf23/art/Kurosu-Ekusu-PNG-1190007429](https://www.deviantart.com/airielashf23/art/Kurosu-Ekusu-PNG-1190007429)[1][2]\n*   [https://www.deviantart.com/airielashf23/art/KUROSU-EKUSU-PNG-1098478398](https://www.deviantart.com/airielashf23/art/KUROSU-EKUSU-PNG-1098478398)[1][2]\n*   [https://www.deviantart.com/moises2000moi/art/Kurosu-Ekusu-PNG-1340471763](https://www.deviantart.com/moises2000moi/art/Kurosu-Ekusu-PNG-1340471763)[2]\n*   [https://www.deviantart.com/zstarx/art/Beyblade-X-Ekusu-Kurosu-981898479](https://www.deviantart.com/zstarx/art/Beyblade-X-Ekusu-Kurosu-981898479)[3][4]\n\nEkusu Kurosu is also known as Jaxon Cross in English, and sometimes uses the alias Blader X or Kamen X.[5][6][7] He is a central character in the Beyblade X anime and manga.[5][6][8]\n\nSources:\n[1] [deviantart.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE80ipYtDd6vKbk3gzMREhP3nHZEriXUYojd8XpVBDQhVG0qRVg_L5EjbAaYaUFGYy4rjahmeCGmC4YFVlT1rRokjBCP7a3y8LZomtNQYMib7g5VmSxVRUSB_SE4VhSNt_I0I7DLTErR6yy088h4OHwPRu9L9gmqyBFhhmOLZA6qBrmkY-FKJzFTw==)\n[2] [deviantart.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFn_Lx98e-55x1dIWWLTMIA2HeDVa7jzZiBqp4V_jh7JD7UYRiNx6RsGDz0I8b5y_BOT-XGqD0eL4zSHi8TCwWuPJqgv4ou-6J95ltDAk7e1t_OQbUmatbWyyW6kxV-2UnSx_GDCl8dIDDCI8-KeOs9x7MDBuPnnUAdDC2MZSZn_Sqi)\n[3] [deviantart.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFNUt0pmfgxKZxJjBWWcGsbk8OP5mT4cK-scs6dcUJuOQKXbfHVjBpYma39C8SbQDxtsqOZJEru85IUAl_1ynWYfZKKNLFrCaPz22VvcQ80dLSyPiqdJw_JgQcdjDpr0T1wI96PffZ-NZ7kcCQbIl5tnI4WkzbdVOcF_jKgKWaBtUUZZQ==)\n[4] [deviantart.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFWnLcNSxjlWrQVdFlLARHQhephtm