  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the Query\'s Scope**\n\nI\'m delving into the user\'s request, focusing on identifying the critical aspects. I\'m parsing the phrasing to precisely understand which functionalities\342\200\224community configuration, tournament setup\342\200\224should be managed from both the frontend and the database, and which aspects should *not* be encapsulated within those areas. I aim to pinpoint the essential components for a comprehensive solution.\n\n\n**Structuring the UI Components**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on UI organization. \"Formato del Torneo\" is critical, needs to be first in the sidebar, *before* \"Battle Console.\" I\'ve separated screens into \"Community Settings\" and \"Tournament Format.\" I\'m also ensuring \"Community State\" goes under \"Community Settings,\" and the \"Start Tournament\" function belongs to \"Tournament Format\" section to manage the \"Register Blader and Roster\" actions.\n\n\n**Organizing the Dashboard Structure**\n\nI\'m now arranging the \"Battle Console\" UI elements. I\'ve broken it down into \"Bracket/\303\201rbol\", \"Bladers & Roster\", and \"Matches/Fixture.\" Additionally, I\'ve integrated \"Config. Comunidad\", \"Equipamiento X\", \"Reglas Oficiales,\" and \"Historial\" within the dashboard for a more complete picture. I\'m focusing on the \"Formato del Torneo\" content, which includes combat rules, tournament format, battle scale and victory conditions, so that I don\'t miss anything.\n\n\n**Defining Tournament Initialization**\n\nI\'m now detailing the \"INICIAR TORNEO\" card. The UI includes a Rocket icon, title, text confirming official settings, and a prominent \"COMENZAR TORNEO >\" button. Clicking this triggers the `\'bladers\'` screen and saves the tournament format. I\'m also ensuring database persistence for tournament rules within Supabase in the `tournament_config` table. Additionally, I\'m working to expand the content of \"Configuraci\303\263n de la Comunidad\" by including customizable, one-click community templates.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 2
      nanos: 583076233
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
